{"title":"마왕은 학원에 간다","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=czykrT/hAC1LPJ32R/7Rkn5K8BMgrYdySC09bYO0&filename=th3","synopsis":"내가 쓴 소설의 악플을 읽다가 열 뻗쳐서 죽어버렸다.\n\n그렇게 갑자기 죽어버린 것도 어이가 없는 상황인데, 웬 저승사자(?)가 나타나 개연성 밥 말아 먹음의 죄로 인해 내가 쓴 소설에 들어가 엔딩 이후까지 살아남는 것으로 속죄해야 천국에 갈 수 있다고 말하기 시작했다.\n\n결국 내가 원하는 대로 <마왕은 죽었다> 소설 속으로 들어왔지만….\n\n\n\"빌어먹을!!! 말도 안돼에에에!!\"\n\n내가 빙의한 건 전투 능력 전무의 초반부터 죽고 시작하는…\n마왕의 아들?!","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":252,"change":{"type":"up","amount":12}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":267,"change":{"type":"down","amount":15}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":280,"change":{"type":"down","amount":13}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":270,"change":{"type":"up","amount":10}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":183,"change":{"type":"up","amount":87}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":253,"change":{"type":"down","amount":70}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":259,"change":{"type":"down","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":246,"change":{"type":"up","amount":13}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":253,"change":{"type":"down","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":265,"change":{"type":"down","amount":12}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":284,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":281,"change":{"type":"up","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":292,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":290,"change":{"type":"up","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":208,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":254,"change":{"type":"down","amount":46}},{"date":"2026-09-03","rank":268,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-04","rank":254,"change":{"type":"up","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-09-05","rank":254,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-06","rank":272,"change":{"type":"down","amount":18}},{"date":"2026-09-07","rank":272,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-08","rank":281,"change":{"type":"down",